  "body": "Unbeatable Value!\r\n\r\nThis brand new townhouse stands out from the crowd in so many ways.\r\n\r\n1. Generous proportions – An impressive 152m² of floor area plus 2 car parking\r\n2.Outstanding location - Positioned on a quiet street on St Heliers border, with the beach, village shops, cafés and excellent schooling all walkable.\r\n3. Premium-home specification – The same high-quality materials typically specified in the developer’s $3 million-plus homes.\r\n\r\nBuilt by the trusted team at Assure Build and beautifully curated by Yellowfox Interiors, every detail has been carefully considered to create a home that feels warm, refined and effortlessly liveable. Designer finishes, premium materials and timeless styling combine to deliver a home that is as functional as it is beautiful.\r\n\r\nThe versatile floor plan has been thoughtfully designed to adapt to every stage of life, offering three generous bedrooms, two separate living areas or the flexibility of a fourth bedroom. Seamless indoor-outdoor flow and light-filled living spaces create the perfect setting for both relaxed family living and effortless entertaining.\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned just moments from St Heliers Village, the beach and the open green spaces of Churchill Park, this is a lifestyle location that is second to none. Simply move in, unpack and enjoy everything this sought-after coastal community has to offer.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n• Brand-new boutique residence backed by a 10-Year Master Build Guarantee\r\n• Three generous bedrooms with two separate living areas or optional fourth bedroom\r\n• Designer interiors by Yellowfox with premium finishes throughout\r\n• Bespoke kitchen with stone benchtops and high-end appliances\r\n• Seamless indoor-outdoor flow designed for entertaining and everyday living\r\n• Two off-street car parks plus generous internal storage\r\n• Easy walk to St Heliers Village, the beach and Churchill Park\r\n• Zoned for St Heliers School and Glendowie College, both within a 10-minute walk\r\n\r\nLuxury, quality and location come together to create an exceptional home in one of Auckland's most desirable coastal suburbs. Opportunities to secure a brand-new residence of this calibre are rare.\r\n\r\nCall to arrange your private viewing appointment. Don't miss out!",
